 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t an objective “best” dentist for everyone, but a good starting point in Phoenix is **AZPerio**, which lists board-certified periodontists who focus on implants and related procedures such as bone grafting. Its Central Phoenix office is at **5300 N. Central Ave., Suite 130**; the listed phone number is **(602) 242-2588**. [AZPerio](https://azperio.com/dental-implants/)\n\nBefore choosing, confirm the specific clinician’s credentials and ask for a written treatment plan, total cost, who places the implant and who restores it, and what follow-up or warranty is included. It’s sensible to get a second opinion—especially if you’ve been told you need extensive grafting or full-mouth treatment.",
